alogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.59,Title,,0,0,0,,The Superhumans of Enies LobbyDialogue: 1,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.59,Title,,0,0,0,,The Superhumans of Enies LobbyDialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,F... F...Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:57.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:57.98,Main,,0,0,0,,F...Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Frog!Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:02.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't "ribbit" me, you jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:09.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The train got derailed because of your slap!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.07,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Step aside! Step aside!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:14.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,– We're gonna collide! – Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:18.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We were finally about to catch  up to Sanji and the others!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna do about it?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You little...! I'm gonna eat you, jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:37.31,Main,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on with this sea train?Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:39.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys okay?Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Somehow...Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,M-My back...Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:55.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Our king bulls disappeared!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:56.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:58.39,Main,,0,0,0,,They disappeared?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:03:00.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's probably us who disappeared.Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.37,Main,,0,0,0,,We probably got derailed.Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:05.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's worse!Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:06.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What're we gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,– Hey! – Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Are we okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,We'd better still be able to get to Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:18.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait a sec!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That being said...Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,we got into a weird current.Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.97,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san.Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:27.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:30.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know which direction the island is?Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:30.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:34.87,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea train already comes  equipped with eternal poses,Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,for the islands with stations.Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:38.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Then it'll be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll check the sea, so please control the train!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:41.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna...Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:45.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Me?Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:47.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a navigator!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:51.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That's reassuring!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.45,0:03:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, before that...Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:57.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yokozuna!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:03:59.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Get over here!Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:08.85,Main,,0,0,0,,He jumped!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:16.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You're glad that we're okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:18.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Geez...Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't get kidnapped!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You jumped the gun.Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.00,0:04:23.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit?Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:29.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Grandma's talking with Yokozuna?Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:35.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you guys doing?Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That frog from earlier and Granny are talking.Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Then Granny is a frog?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.98,0:04:44.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true that she's more frog than human.Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are gonna get beaten up later.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:48.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you are.Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:52.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Rocketman!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you see them?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I don't!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn huge frog!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:01.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did he send Straw Hat and the others flying?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.41,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no time for grumbling!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We set out to sea in order to rescue Big Bro Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:09.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:14.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We just have to believe that Rocketman will be back,  and keep moving forward to Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Sodom! Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:22.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:25.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Look ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:29.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I've found more detached cars!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:31.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether they're friend or foe is unknown!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:33.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, prepare for battle!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:37.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahoy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.99,0:05:40.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Is anyone in there?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We're the Franky Family!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Show your face!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone came out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.70,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He's alive?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,Puffing Tom  Car No. 1Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,Puffing Tom  Car No. 1Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Is it... really true?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:57.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,so I was told.Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That darn Stupid-burg!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I was totally convinced that he was killed!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:11.15,Main,,0,0,0,,CP9 might be thinking that they killed him.Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:13.72,Main,,0,0,0,,It's better if you keep it to yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:20.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't what you're doing called "kindness"?Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:26.91,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate...Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,the government has now successfully  obtained the two keys.Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Me, who has a weapon's blueprints,Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:41.00,Main,,0,0,0,,and you, who can revive an existing weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,When that power actually appears in this world,Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:52.13,Main,,0,0,0,,the government will, naturally, end this pirate era.Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,After that, this military power will become too much  to handle. It will grip the world and destroy it.Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:07:00.85,Main,,0,0,0,,The ancient weapons are that much of a threat.Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:05.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Our master didn't lay down his  life protecting the blueprints...Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:09.64,Main,,0,0,0,,for such a stupid future!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:16.03,Main,,0,0,0,,even if I could escape, it's pointless if it's just me.Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to go back to the Straw Hats somehow too!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.02,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I hurt them just by being with them.Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:30.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ever since she can remember,Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:33.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,her existence itself was a sin.Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not you who hurts them, is it?Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:47.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The people from the government say your existence is a sin,Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:50.49,Main,,0,0,0,,but no matter what weapons you're carrying,Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.99,Main,,0,0,0,,your being there isn't a sin.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:58.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No matter what kind of ship it is,Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:00.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,the act of building it...Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:03.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,is neither an act of good nor evil!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:06.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:09.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Her existence itself was a sin.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,No...!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:15.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Your existence isn't a sin!Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what happened to your body?Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It's full of scars!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Since...Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,that day eight years ago...Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Since that incident where Tom-san was taken away...Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,you've been challenging the sea train every single day.Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:09:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanted to become strong, right?Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:05.27,Main,,0,0,0,,So that you won't lose those you love again...Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:09.51,Main,,0,0,0,,So that you can protect those you love...Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.51,0:09:10.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit...Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:12.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna...Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:17.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Now's the time for you to show  the result of that training!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit?Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:23.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Your dear Franky has beenDialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,taken away just like Tom-san was.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:31.67,Main,,0,0,0,,This train is currently headed towards where he is.Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:35.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna come along?Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:39.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit... Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:41.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:44.31,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got one more comrade!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Just as we'd expect from Monster Granny!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:51.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Or, are you actually Frog Granny?Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:09:59.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares?Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I found a good current! It's in the eight o'clock direction!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:04.35,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We've wasted quite a bit of time.Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:10.53,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll recover it in an instant!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:13.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Frog!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,CP9 has arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:27.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Judicial Island Enies LobbyDialogue: 1,0:10:21.85,0:10:27.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Judicial Island Enies LobbyDialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:24.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Good work on your long-term mission, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring the criminals out! They're in car No. 1!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:32.66,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:34.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Treat me with care, idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:39.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Don't come this way!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful! He'll bite you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What a noisy man...Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Just as you'd expect from CP9.Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.99,0:10:56.77,Main,,0,0,0,,How intimidating.Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,He's Cutty Flam, right?Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Then that woman is...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What a beauty!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Open the main gate!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:29.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa...!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:31.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this place?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:43.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this... a waterfall?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:55.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't see the bottom!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.01,0:11:57.27,Main,,0,0,0,,How noisy.Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.46,0:12:06.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like Lucci and the others are headed this way...Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:15.89,Main,,0,0,0,,bringing the best possible gift to us.Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:19.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:25.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Today is a joyous day. All eight members of CP9, including me,Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:29.10,Main,,0,0,0,,are to gather together in one place for the first time in five years.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:32.06,Main,,0,0,0,,And yet, what's up with this article?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The orders to assassinate the heads of the local branches...Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:40.23,Main,,0,0,0,,of the Revolutionary Army only  required you to kill three of them,Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:42.78,Main,,0,0,0,,but twenty-three of them are dead!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,If you have an excuse, I'd really like to hear it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I am very sorry, Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:56.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It is all...Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.79,Main,,0,0,0,,my fault!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:02.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,CP9 (Six Powers Master) JabraDialogue: 1,0:12:57.75,0:13:02.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,CP9 (Six Powers Master) JabraDialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:12:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Kumadori!Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:02.21,Main,,0,0,0,,A man shouldn't apologize so easily!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll explain what happened to Chief, so just sit tight!Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,CP9 (Six Powers Master) FukuroDialogue: 2,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.68,Captions,,0,0,0,,CP9 (Six Powers Master) FukuroDialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:10.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:12.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,CP9 (Six Powers Master) KumadoriDialogue: 1,0:13:08.22,0:13:12.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,CP9 (Six Powers Master) KumadoriDialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:12.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this,Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:16.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility by committing ritual suicide.Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculousıDialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:19.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong, Chief!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:23.94,Main,,0,0,0,,On the instructed day, we infiltrated  them to carry out the assassinations,Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:26.74,Main,,0,0,0,,but somehow they managed  to find out about our plans.Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:30.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I talked about the assassination plan in town!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:34.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You again, Fukuro?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the point of that zipper on your mouth?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.89,Main,,0,0,0,,When are you going to fix  these flapping lips of yours?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.89,0:13:42.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We're intelligence agents who have  to strictly keep things top secret!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I went and talked about it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:46.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't "chapapa" us!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:52.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't blame Fukuro!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:56.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility by committing ritual suicide.Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.77,0:13:58.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,How regrettable! I can't die.Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:06.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Just die already, you jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:11.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, that's enough...Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:15.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! I spilled my coffee! Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:18.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, they said that Nero was useless.Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:19.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't we go any faster?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:40.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey... Hey, then, Big Bro Franky  sacrificed himself and...Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,He tried to save Robin-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What an amazing guy Bro is!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry up or it'll be too late.Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, we can see the lights of  the nightless island! It's Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:09.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that true? All right!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.93,Main,,0,0,0,,We can go rescue Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Nightless island?Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:18.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They don't have nights on that island. It's also called a day island.Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:21.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the Judicial Island.Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We found them!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Huge king bulls!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.83,0:15:30.99,Main,,0,0,0,,– Ribbit! – Ahoy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:39.66,Main,,0,0,0,,– Ribbit! Ribbit! – Ah! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:41.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:42.67,Secondary,,0,0,0,,It's been a while...Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:46.40,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:51.68,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems that we were able to join up with them smoothly, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:55.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're ready and willing to march  into the entrance of the World Government!Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That sounds reassuring!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:06.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Enies Lobby has come into sight!Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get ready for the showdown!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Sogeking from Sniper Island?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm Usopp-kun's best friend.Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here because he requested that I assist you.Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,A h-hero!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you're wearing a cape,  I thought that might be the case...Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:38.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing! I've never seen a hero before!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! He's a hero because he's wearing a cape?Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! Cape buffalos are heroes, too!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:47.88,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if someone is wearing  a cape, they're usually a hero.Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Usopp.Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:49.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Usopp... I'm glad he's okay.Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the long nose who marched  into the Franky House.Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:56.11,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the long nose who got caught with Bro.Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:57.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:58.81,Main,,0,0,0,,N-Nice to meet you.Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That's one of the guys I met at Shift Station.Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:05.71,Main,,0,0,0,,– May I have your autograph? – Sure.Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,"To Chopper-kun"Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:11.80,Main,,0,0,0,,But then, where did Usopp go?Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:15.22,Main,,0,0,0,,He's fine. You don't have to worry about him at all.Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:20.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he told me to put all my energy  into rescuing Robin-kun and left.Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Yep. He's right.Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:26.06,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Where is this Sniper Island?Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:28.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It's...Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:32.33,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ On Sniper Island... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:40.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ I was... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.07,0:17:45.76,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,♪ born... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ On Sniper Island... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:52.80,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ I was born... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:56.41,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ I was born... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:18:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ A hundred shots... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ A hundred hits... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,In your...Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,hearts.Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,– Our hearts...!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:46.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's that?Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:53.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:57.89,Main,,0,0,0,,– Nami-san... – Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:17:59.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Sanji-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,And all you idiots here with Nami-san...Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:07.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Before we go rescue Robin-chan, let me tell you one thing.Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,So, CP9 is taking advantage of the root cause of Robin-chan's vulnerability.Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:25.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to make excuses  for not bringing her back.Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:32.18,Main,,0,0,0,,But even if we march into our enemy's territory,  it doesn't necessarily mean that she'll let us help her.Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna stand for this!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:42.93,Main,,0,0,0,,– That darn Robin! – Why Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:47.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Why not?! Why the heck doesn't she want us to come rescue her?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,She's suffering thinking about what  might happen to us after she's rescued!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:53.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:56.29,Main,,0,0,0,,If we don't do anything, she'll be killed, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:58.49,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way she wants to die, so we'll rescue her!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course that's true, but...Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:04.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't bother. Either way, what we have to do is the same.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:07.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll just rescue her.Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.80,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll bring down the whole place!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a technique that I wanna try, too!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.21,0:19:20.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys, take a look at this.Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:24.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been to that island once, for railway maintenance.Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:27.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I drew this based on my vague recollection of it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:30.51,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a rough sketch of what Enies Lobby looks like.Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice are at the back of the island,Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:41.64,Main,,0,0,0,,and they only seem to be accessible  via the Tower of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:43.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this? What's this dark area?Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It indicates a waterfall.Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:46.77,Main,,0,0,0,,A waterfall?Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, you'll know what I mean once you're in there.Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:53.01,Main,,0,0,0,,If we can't recover Nico Robin  and Franky on this straight pathDialogue: 5,0:19:53.01,0:19:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,from the main gate to the Gates of Justice,Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:52.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,m -113 -57 l 109 -57 109 13 -113 13Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:52.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,m -113 -57 l 109 -57 109 13 -113 13Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:52.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,m -113 -57 l 109 -57 109 13 -113 13Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:52.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,m -113 -57 l 109 -57 109 13 -113 13Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:52.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,m -113 -57 l 109 -57 109 13 -113 13Dialogue: 0,