ill have lost.Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:20:02.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! No matter where Robin is taken to, we can  just keep going after them until we get her back!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.63,0:20:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I explained this before we left Water 7, didn't I?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The only destinations beyond those gates are  Navy Headquarters and the undersea prison.Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,So we have to settle this matter  before that at any cost.Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.87,0:20:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,She's right.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:20.39,Main,,0,0,0,,That being said, even if we all rush in,Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.39,0:20:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,if we encounter CP9, you guys are the only ones who can defeat them.Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:29.41,Main,,0,0,0,,After the train ride together,  I now know well how strong you guys are.Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.41,0:20:32.77,Main,,0,0,0,,So, you guys wait here on the sea for five minutes,Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:36.38,Main,,0,0,0,,then charge into the main island in Rocketman, through the main gate.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:40.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll go in first to break open  the main gate and the island gate...Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.97,Main,,0,0,0,,so that the train can pass through.Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:48.85,Main,,0,0,0,,After that, we'd like you to keep on moving no matter how many of us fall.Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:53.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We're only a little over 60 people,Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:56.81,Main,,0,0,0,,but our enemy's forces are probably  well above 2,000 to 3,000.Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:21:03.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We'd like you guys to only go after CP9,  avoiding unnecessary battles.Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:09.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys! We're now at the front of the island!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:13.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at the sky behind Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.26,0:21:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are the Gates of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoooa! That's huge!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,They never open all the way.Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,When criminals go through them, they open just a little.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.00,0:21:38.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Behind those doors is a nest of large  sea kings; just like the Calm Belt,Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:42.90,Main,,0,0,0,,the sea areas that lie on both  sides of the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:45.61,Main,,0,0,0,,So no ordinary ships can go in there.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:52.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but the Navy are  able to pass through there safely.Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, just like the pirate girl said,Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:59.44,Main,,0,0,0,,if you want to rescue a criminal  who's been taken away,Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,you've got until the moment before they go through those gates to do it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.13,0:22:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, there's no time to lose!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.81,0:22:12.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, as we planned, we're gonna go in first!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.11,0:22:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We've got you covered!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!  Aren't you supposed to be with us?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Where's Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:27.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? He was right here a second ago.Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:37.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.13,0:22:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:44.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:47.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is he doing things on his own?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:50.76,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy doesn't have a clue about the plan at all!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:54.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That was a waste.Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:56.22,Main,,0,0,0,,He said he got it, didn't he?Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:22:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not the type who can wait five minutes.Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We should've known.Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:05.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What an impatient guy he is.Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:07.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! Pirate guy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.73,0:23:11.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:14.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind! Sodom! Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.66,0:23:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Climb up the iron fence and break open the main gate!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:25.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.55,0:23:27.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Rocket!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.43,0:23:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.77,0:23:35.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I just saw something flying!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.09,0:23:42.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the heck is this place?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.97,0:23:46.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What a huge hole! It looks like the island is floating.Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.23,0:23:49.76,Main,,0,0,0,,There's someone up there!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It's an intruder! Shoot him down!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.99,0:23:55.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Oops, they found me.Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.47,0:24:00.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He went inside the gate!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.77,0:24:08.05,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the main gate! This is the main gate!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.05,0:24:10.34,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a report to Chief and the island gate!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.97,0:24:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the main gate! Please come in!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.91,0:24:17.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:21.77,Main,,0,0,0,,An intruder went over the main gate,  and is currently dashing towards the island gate!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.77,0:24:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just an intruder. Calm down and take care of him.Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.32,0:24:27.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.45,0:24:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the island gate.  We confirmed the intruder.Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of him right away. Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.91,0:24:39.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey. Stop this, kid.Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.61,0:24:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this place is?Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.45,0:24:45.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Deal with him carefully. If my eyes didn't deceive me, that man is...Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.67,0:24:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.18,0:24:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What did you just say?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.30,0:24:59.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I think that's Straw Hat...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.72,0:25:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,A pirate with a 100-million-belly bounty on his head!Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.32,0:25:10.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin...Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.04,0:25:30.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.95,0:26:02.14,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Another report from the main gate!Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.14,0:26:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.50,0:26:13.70,Main,,0,0,0,,A suspicious group on a monster carriage  has just passed over the front fence!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.55,0:26:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Please send reinforcements!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.59,0:26:20.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Please send-Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.94,0:26:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:31.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatekeeper!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.24,0:26:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Come in!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:35.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What is going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.08,0:26:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.71,0:26:49.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't stop.Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.49,0:27:18.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you guys ready?Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.75,0:27:21.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.24,0:27:24.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, because...Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.51,0:27:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.19,0:27:35.38,Main,,0,0,0,,In four minutes... the sea train, Rocketman, will charge in!Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.76,0:27:47.60,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000, Lance PhosCity  Quality Control: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Mr. Luffy, Pepperjack, Sewil  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: Crunchyroll, GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialo